## Meeting Outcome

The team aligned on a phased approach: **start with a laptop-based GitHub Actions self-hosted runner, continue deploying to AWS, and then evaluate a more permanent build platform with cost optimization in mind**. Artifact handling will move toward CI-generated artifacts stored in GitHub Actions. CodeQL and Dependabot remain dependent on resolving GitHub plan/access limitations.

